cff-version: 1.2.0
title: depthSV
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-02"
repository-code: https://github.com/jlanej/depthSV
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Association testing of sequencing read depth against phenotypes at biobank
  scale. Joins per-sample depth over fixed genomic bins, corrects for technical
  structure using principal components and a sex-chromosome ploidy model, and
  tests each bin against one or more phenotypes with the removed components in
  the model, producing association summary statistics with permutation-based
  genome-wide thresholds.
# Replace with the authors' names and ORCIDs before a release; a Zenodo DOI
# minted on the release tag belongs in `identifiers`.
authors:
  - name: depthSV contributors
keywords:
  - copy number variation
  - structural variation
  - read depth
  - genome-wide association study
  - biobank
